<title>NETHERLANDS: Akzo Nobel in venture with Courtaulds.</title>
<headline>Akzo Nobel in venture with Courtaulds.</headline>
<dateline>ARNHEM, Netherlands 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch chemical group Akzo Nobel NV said on Thursday it was in a joint venture with British group Courtaulds.  </p>
<p>Akzo Nobel and Courtaulds announced a further step forward in their collaborative programme for the commercial developement of NewCall, lyocell (solvent spun) callulesie filament yarn.</p>
<p>The two companies have agreed to undertake a detailed engineering study for the construction of a commercial scale plant to be located in Europe.</p>
</text>
